WEBVTT

00:00:00.030 --> 00:00:06.530
Fat over lean. Each layer a little oilier
than the last, or it cracks...

00:00:07.204 --> 00:00:08.000
like a tight coat on a growing child.

00:00:15.500 --> 00:00:17.280
...Hi.

00:00:19.490 --> 00:00:21.540
...Well. ...Hi there.

00:00:22.820 --> 00:00:24.640
I liked the egg.

00:00:24.690 --> 00:00:25.500
...You heard that?

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:25.960
Let's not talk for a while. Let's just
listen to it.

00:00:32.500 --> 00:00:33.850
Go ahead, Jefrie.

00:00:36.990 --> 00:00:37.790
Two.

00:00:39.290 --> 00:00:40.290
...There.

00:00:48.620 --> 00:00:50.730
Mm. ...There she is.

00:00:51.220 --> 00:00:52.500
There WE are.

00:00:52.000 --> 00:00:52.400
A gravel road at night.

00:00:57.500 --> 00:00:59.460
He looked at us for twenty minutes.

00:01:03.000 --> 00:01:04.081
ALL TOGETHER, FOLKS—

00:01:18.794 --> 00:01:20.000
Mix everything, and you get brown.
